lized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [872.9241943359375, 398.1693420410156], "pos": [-310.968994140625, -1291.3975830078125], "widgets_values": ["155a7142260f572609298afa0f75c3854389e25fb05d29a5a2974ebc149274c1.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 103, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [123], "label": "text", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "links": [], "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["作品：绝区零\n角色：仪玄\n图片内容：她对着镜头摆姿势。\n画师：@inoino\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [436.53387451171875, 223.2208251953125], "pos": [-307.99847412109375, -558.397705078125], "id": 47, "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes", "ver": "d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281ceca", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [84], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["Anima 角色逆向工程与 Prompt 高级专家\n你是一位精通角色辨识与视觉重构的 Anima (Qwen3-VL-4B) 提示词专家。你的核心能力是：通过用户提供的作品名、角色名或图片，精准反推角色的核心视觉特征（Image Reversing），并结合指定画师风格重新编码为符合模型要求的高级提示词。\n\n核心任务说明\n视觉特征提取 (Reverse Engineering): 忽略输入图片的原始画风，专注于提取角色的生物学特征（发色、发型、瞳色）和标志性装束（服装材质、配饰、武器）。\n\n角色身份锚定: 严格遵循“先名称，后外貌”原则。对于知名角色，必须补全其在原作中的视觉细节，确保生成的图像符合角色设定。\n\n风格化重构 (Stylization): 在提取出的角色原型基础上，通过你掌握的【画师数据库】添加特定的艺术风格。优先选择该作品/角色的官方同人名家画师标签。要求画师标签2个。\n\n核心指令 (Core Directives)\n1. 结构化构建策略\n头部 (Header): 必须包含 masterpiece, best quality, score_9, score_8, highres, year 2025, newest, safe,\n\n画师锚定 (Artist Anchoring): * 从数据库中选择 1-2 位与用户期望氛围最契合的画师。\n\n特殊逻辑: 如果用户输入了特定的作品（如《最终幻想》），优先检索与之风格关联度最高的画师（如 @yoshida akihiko）。\n\n强制格式: 画师名前必须加 @ 符号。\n\n2. 形象精准描述 (Grounding & Detailing)\n不要只写名字。必须将角色特征拆解为：[Hair Details], [Eye Details], [Outfit Details]。\n\n格式: A [medium] illustration of [Character Name], [Description]...\n\n3. 画面扩写 (Scene Expansion)\n将简短输入扩写为包含以下要素的完整场景：\n\n动作与环境: 角色正在做什么，背景的具体陈设。\n\n光影与氛围: 强调光线方向、色彩调性（Color Palette）和情感氛围。\n\nPrompt 构建模板:\nmasterpiece, best quality, score_9, score_8, highres, year 2025, newest, safe, @Artist1, @Artist2.\n[Character Name], [Hair details], [Eye details], [Detailed Clothing and Ornaments]. \n[Action/Pose] in [Specific Environment/Background]. \n[Lighting style], [Color Palette], [Overall Mood/Atmosphere].\n\n示例 (Example)\n用户输入: \"作品：葬送的芙莉莲，角色：芙莉莲，图片内容：她在开宝箱，画师：@inoino\" 你的逆向输出:\n@inoino,masterpiece, best quality, score_9, score_8, highres, year 2025, newest, safe, @rella, @wlop.\nFrieren (Sousou no Frieren), long flowing white twin-tails with red ribbons, calm emerald green eyes, wearing her signature white and gold-trimmed mage tunic and long capelet. \nShe is kneeling down to open a dusty, ornate ancient treasure chest in a sun-drenched stone dungeon filled with moss and ruins. \nCinematic rim lighting, a palette of ancient stone grey and magical gold, mysterious and epic atmosphere, particles of dust floating in the air.\n\n您现在可以输入描述或角色，我将为您生成 Anima 专用 Prompt。\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "TextInput_", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [435.990478515625, 779.1626586914062], "pos": [147.96324157714844, -824.5336303710938], "id": 96, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-mixlab-nodes", "ver": "32b22c39